# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Commit message template (see CONTRIBUTING.md → 提交信息规范)
# All commit messages must be in ENGLISH and follow Conventional Commits.
#
# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#   types : feat fix docs refactor perf test build ci chore style revert
#   scopes: keymap tray inject udev systemd launcher window install docs tools branding
#   subject: imperative mood, lowercase, no trailing period, <= 72 chars
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Why it changed (optional, wrap at 72 chars):

# Footer (optional): BREAKING CHANGE: … / Closes #12 / Refs #34
